{"quests":[{"id":"q_m01","type":"main","title":"A Humble Beginning","desc":"Tavern → Hire one companion. Then claim your reward.","order":1,"goals":[{"stat":"hero.count","target":2,"mode":"abs","text":"Have 2 heroes"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":100}],"req":[],"weight":1,"story":"Maren sets a second cup by the hearth. The first companion has answered your banner; the Lantern Road begins with two people choosing to help.","hint":"bld_tavern","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m02","type":"main","title":"Your First Mission","desc":"Board → Campaign → Slime Meadow. Select your party and fight.","order":2,"goals":[{"stat":"missions.won","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Win a battle"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":80},{"id":"potion_s","n":2}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m01","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"The meadow courier reaches home at last. In the slime's trail, your heroes find a shard of amber glass: the first clue to the missing beacons.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m03","type":"main","title":"Gear Up","desc":"Bag → Gear → Auto equip. Then claim your reward.","order":3,"goals":[{"stat":"gear.equipped","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Equip an item"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":100},{"id":"iron_ore","n":6}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m02","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"The courier leaves a bundle of rescued gear at your door. Maren polishes the amber shard. It glows whenever the party gathers around the hearth.","hint":"tab_bag","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m04","type":"main","title":"Rookie's Triumph","desc":"Clear Gooey Hills, then Mushroom Grove. Heal between battles.","order":4,"goals":[{"stat":"mission.clear.m_r1_3","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Clear Mushroom Grove"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":150},{"id":"fame","n":8}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m03","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Beyond Mushroom Grove, a waystone hums again. The shard fits its hollow. For the first time since the storm, villagers can follow a light home.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m05","type":"main","title":"Forge Ahead","desc":"Build the Blacksmith in the Guild Hall.","order":5,"goals":[{"stat":"facility.blacksmith","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Build the Blacksmith"}],"rewards":[{"id":"iron_ore","n":10},{"id":"gems","n":3}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m04","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Your smith studies the broken lens mount. This was no ordinary lantern: five lenses once carried a message between the valleys and the Spire.","hint":"bld_blacksmith","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m06","type":"main","title":"Strength Through Sweat","desc":"Build the Training Hall.","order":6,"goals":[{"stat":"facility.training","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Build the Training Hall"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":200},{"id":"tome_s","n":1}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m05","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"An old training bell rings across the courtyard. Maren once learned here too. She offers her first lesson: a guild grows by helping each other improve.","hint":"bld_training","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m07","type":"main","title":"Train a Hero","desc":"Send a hero to train in the Training Hall.","order":7,"goals":[{"stat":"train.done","target":1,"mode":"delta","text":"Finish a training session"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":150},{"id":"tome_s","n":1}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m06","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Practice turns a hesitant recruit into a dependable companion. Your heroes mark the next route together. No one will have to walk it alone.","hint":"bld_training","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m08","type":"main","title":"The Slime Throne","desc":"Defeat the King Slime at the end of Sunmeadow Plains.","order":8,"goals":[{"stat":"mission.clear.m_r1_5","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Defeat King Slime"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":300},{"id":"gems","n":5},{"id":"soul_seal","n":1}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m07","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"The King Slime releases an amber lens from its crown. Sunmeadow's beacon blooms gold. Across the valley, a distant tower answers with a single flash.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m09","type":"main","title":"Prove Your Worth","desc":"Earn 100 Fame to become eligible for the Rank E exam.","order":9,"goals":[{"stat":"rank.fame","target":100,"mode":"abs","text":"Reach 100 Fame"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gems","n":3},{"id":"gold","n":200}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m08","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Farmers bring bread, letters, and news of your deeds. The council has noticed the reopened road. An invitation to the guild trials arrives at dawn.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m10","type":"main","title":"Rank E Trial","desc":"Pass the Rank E exam from the Quest Board.","order":10,"goals":[{"stat":"rank.index","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Reach Guild Rank E"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":500},{"id":"gems","n":10},{"id":"x_amulet_2","n":1}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m09","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Your new seal grants passage into Whisperwood. Maren recognizes the flash from the tower: the old keepers are asking Emberhall to finish their work.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m11","type":"main","title":"Into the Whisperwood","desc":"Clear Moonlit Glade in Whisperwood.","order":11,"goals":[{"stat":"mission.clear.m_r2_3","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Clear Moonlit Glade"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":350},{"id":"fame","n":20}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m10","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Under silver leaves, your party follows a trail of blue sparks. A forest keeper has hidden the second lens beyond the glade, safe from the storm.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m12","type":"main","title":"Mend and Make Do","desc":"Build the Infirmary so wounded heroes can recover.","order":12,"goals":[{"stat":"facility.infirmary","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Build the Infirmary"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":250},{"id":"potion_m","n":2}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m11","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"The infirmary opens with fresh linen and flowers. Maren places a lamp by every bed. Bringing everyone home matters more than arriving first.","hint":"bld_infirmary","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m13","type":"main","title":"Strength in Numbers","desc":"Grow your guild to 5 heroes.","order":13,"goals":[{"stat":"hero.count","target":5,"mode":"abs","text":"Have 5 heroes"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gems","n":5},{"id":"gold","n":400}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m12","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Five companions share a table once built for one. Their maps overlap, their stories differ, and their laughter makes the old hall feel like home.","hint":"bld_tavern","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m14","type":"main","title":"Queen of Coils","desc":"Defeat the Lamia Queen in her lair.","order":14,"goals":[{"stat":"mission.clear.m_r2_5","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Defeat the Lamia Queen"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":600},{"id":"gems","n":8},{"id":"soul_seal","n":2}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m13","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"The Lamia Queen yields the forest lens to those who have earned her respect. Whisperwood glows blue; two restored beacons now trace a path south.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m15","type":"main","title":"Rank D Trial","desc":"Reach Guild Rank D.","order":15,"goals":[{"stat":"rank.index","target":2,"mode":"abs","text":"Reach Guild Rank D"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":1000},{"id":"gems","n":15},{"id":"x_ring_3","n":1}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m14","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"The council entrusts your guild with the caravan roads. Beyond the dunes lies a third beacon, buried beneath the route the storm erased.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m16","type":"main","title":"The Beast Within","desc":"Tame a monster at the Tavern's Beast Den.","order":16,"goals":[{"stat":"monster.tamed","target":1,"mode":"delta","text":"Tame a monster"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gems","n":10},{"id":"essence","n":5}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m15","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"A new creature curls up beside the hearth. It knows paths no map can show. Maren quietly adds another bowl to the supper table.","hint":"bld_tavern","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m17","type":"main","title":"Tyrant of the Dunes","desc":"Defeat the Sand Tyrant.","order":17,"goals":[{"stat":"mission.clear.m_r3_5","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Defeat the Sand Tyrant"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":1500},{"id":"gems","n":10},{"id":"soul_seal","n":2}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m16","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"The Sand Tyrant falls and the buried beacon rises. Its lens shines rose-gold. Caravans sound their bells as three valleys reconnect at last.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m18","type":"main","title":"Rank C Trial","desc":"Reach Guild Rank C.","order":18,"goals":[{"stat":"rank.index","target":3,"mode":"abs","text":"Reach Guild Rank C"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":2500},{"id":"gems","n":20},{"id":"essence","n":8}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m17","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Your banner now flies at every caravan stop. An archivist sends a rubbing from Gloomhold: the five lenses form a map, not a weapon.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m19","type":"main","title":"Into the Crypt","desc":"Defeat the Minotaur Warlord in Gloomhold Crypt.","order":19,"goals":[{"stat":"mission.clear.m_r4_5","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Defeat the Warlord"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":3000},{"id":"gems","n":15},{"id":"soul_seal","n":3}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m18","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"The Warlord's vault holds a violet lens and a keeper's letter. Maren reads her mother's handwriting: 'Let every lost traveler find a welcome.'","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m20","type":"main","title":"The Endless Spire","desc":"Climb to floor 10 of the Endless Spire.","order":20,"goals":[{"stat":"mission.tower","target":10,"mode":"abs","text":"Reach Spire floor 10"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gems","n":15},{"id":"essence","n":10}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m19","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"On the Spire's tenth landing, your four lights reveal a hidden stair. The fifth lens waits in Cinder Citadel. The keepers' message is nearly whole.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m21","type":"main","title":"Rank B Trial","desc":"Reach Guild Rank B.","order":21,"goals":[{"stat":"rank.index","target":4,"mode":"abs","text":"Reach Guild Rank B"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":5000},{"id":"gems","n":25},{"id":"x_amulet_4","n":1}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m20","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"The council names Emberhall a guardian of the roads. Maren finally tells the guild why she stayed: her mother believed someone would return to finish the lights.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m22","type":"main","title":"Cinders and Shadows","desc":"Defeat the Black Magus in the Cinder Citadel.","order":22,"goals":[{"stat":"mission.clear.m_r5_5","target":1,"mode":"abs","text":"Defeat the Black Magus"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":8000},{"id":"gems","n":30},{"id":"soul_seal","n":5}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m21","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"The Black Magus relinquishes the last lens. Five colors cross the sky above the Citadel. Far away, Emberhall's hearth answers with a golden flame.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m23","type":"main","title":"Rank A Trial","desc":"Reach Guild Rank A.","order":23,"goals":[{"stat":"rank.index","target":5,"mode":"abs","text":"Reach Guild Rank A"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":12000},{"id":"gems","n":40},{"id":"essence","n":20}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m22","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Letters arrive from every village you helped. The final ascent is ready. Your companions tuck the letters beside the five lenses and set out together.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m24","type":"main","title":"Master of the Spire","desc":"Conquer floor 40 of the Endless Spire.","order":24,"goals":[{"stat":"mission.tower","target":40,"mode":"abs","text":"Reach Spire floor 40"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gems","n":40},{"id":"essence","n":25}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m23","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"At the fortieth landing, the lenses reveal the keeper's map: every road leads to a hearth. The Spire was built to connect people, and yours has answered.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_m25","type":"main","title":"Legend of Emberhall","desc":"Pass the final trial and reach Guild Rank S.","order":25,"goals":[{"stat":"rank.index","target":6,"mode":"abs","text":"Reach Guild Rank S"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":30000},{"id":"gems","n":100},{"id":"essence","n":50}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_m24","min":1}],"weight":1,"story":"Five beacons shine above a world brought together. Maren hangs her mother's map by the door. Below it, a new traveler asks if there is room for one more.","hint":"tab_board","giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_s_slime1","type":"side","title":"Slime Squasher I","desc":"Defeat 20 slimes.","order":26,"goals":[{"stat":"kills.tag.slime","target":20,"mode":"delta"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":120}],"req":[{"stat":"missions.won","min":1}],"weight":1,"giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_s_slime2","type":"side","title":"Slime Squasher II","desc":"Defeat 80 slimes.","order":27,"goals":[{"stat":"kills.tag.slime","target":80,"mode":"delta"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":400},{"id":"gems","n":3}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_s_slime1","min":1}],"weight":1,"giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_s_slime3","type":"side","title":"Slime Squasher III","desc":"Defeat 250 slimes.","order":28,"goals":[{"stat":"kills.tag.slime","target":250,"mode":"delta"}],"rewards":[{"id":"gold","n":1200},{"id":"gems","n":8}],"req":[{"stat":"quest.done.q_s_slime2","min":1}],"weight":1,"giver":"Elder Maren"},{"id":"q_s_undead1","type":"side","title":"Grave Digger I","desc":"Defeat 30 undead.","order":29,"goals"